- **C289–C304** (16 newest coins) are not in the local Oct 8 repo snapshot. The C300 (Bahamas 1984 25c) / C301 (Mexico 1989 500p) possible duplicates are flagged in a separate note (`NOTE_C300_C301_duplicates_20261014.md`, already in the incoming folder).
- **No shared photo files** across any two specimens (checked all 285).
- **No shared provenance input files** across any two specimens (checked all 285).
- Common-coin multiples are **cull candidates, not integrity problems** per Joseph's standing rule — the LOW group above is informational only.

